{"id":400400301,"chapter_id":50016,"scene_id":51633,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"终于，狮子超人发现了诡兽的真实身份。于是她质问星辰诡兽，为什么要一直这样骗自己，明明自己把它当做朋友。","style":2,"background":4073,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"“对不起狮子超人，但这就是我的本性，我生来就是为了破坏。”","style":2,"background":4073,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"尽管心中非常难过，但为了整个城市的安全，狮子超人终于下定决心，与怪物做最后的决战。","style":2,"background":4073,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"“狮子超人，这是最后一战了。”","style":2,"background":4074,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"“认输吧，史达比思特！我不想伤害朋友！”","voice":["vo_event_400400301_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_04003","style":1,"background":4074,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"选项","options":["“狮子超人的末日……”","“消灭狮子超人的计划……”"],"jump":[7,9],"style":6,"background":4074,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"“狮子超人的末日到了！”","style":2,"background":4074,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"“消灭狮子超人的计划，就要在今天实现了！”","style":2,"background":4074,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"“来吧！这座城市由我来守护！”","voice":["vo_event_400400301_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_04003","style":1,"background":4074,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"“拿出你所有的本事吧，我的朋友。”","style":2,"background":4075,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"“这次，我不会再留情了。”","voice":["vo_event_400400301_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_04003","style":1,"background":4075,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"“天真！让你尝尝星辰之力！百万新星射线——————————————————————————————”","style":2,"background":4076,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"“我才不会认输！狮子光能炮！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！”","voice":["vo_event_400400301_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_04003","style":1,"background":4076,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"噗滋滋滋——哔哧哧哧——咔呲呲呲——","voice":["vo_event_400400301_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_04003","style":1,"background":4076,"log_type":1}]}